{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And see</b> — like <b>אשורנו</b> (we shall see)." "<b>Because of the multitude of oppressions</b> — Elihu says: do what you wish, and it does not benefit or harm the Place [HaShem]; only, the Place hears the outcry of the oppressed. <b>מרוב</b> is like <b>מגדולה</b> (from greatness), or in its plain sense, and the former is more correct, for after it comes <b>ישועו מזרוע רבים</b> (Job 35:9)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:33.286743559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}